Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.30,Short,,0,0,0,,Your diaphragm suddenly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:02.40,Short,,0,0,0,,yanks down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:02.96,Short,,0,0,0,,air rushes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:04.04,Short,,0,0,0,,into your lungs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:04.46,Short,,0,0,0,,and a split
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:05.14,Short,,0,0,0,,second later
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.14,0:00:06.16,Short,,0,0,0,,your vocal cords
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:07.26,Short,,0,0,0,,slam shut
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:07.80,Short,,0,0,0,,making that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:09.10,Short,,0,0,0,,hic sound
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:09.92,Short,,0,0,0,,It usually starts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:10.68,Short,,0,0,0,,when your stomach
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.68,0:00:11.68,Short,,0,0,0,,stretches from eating
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:12.42,Short,,0,0,0,,too fast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:13.94,Short,,0,0,0,,or drinking soda
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:14.96,Short,,0,0,0,,irritating the nerves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:15.62,Short,,0,0,0,,that control
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:16.70,Short,,0,0,0,,your breathing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:17.16,Short,,0,0,0,,You see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:18.16,Short,,0,0,0,,some scientists think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:18.86,Short,,0,0,0,,hiccups are left
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:19.36,Short,,0,0,0,,over from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.36,0:00:19.90,Short,,0,0,0,,our ancestors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:20.46,Short,,0,0,0,,that lived
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:20.96,Short,,0,0,0,,in water
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:22.14,Short,,0,0,0,,because tadpoles use
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:22.98,Short,,0,0,0,,the same motion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:23.64,Short,,0,0,0,,to push water
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:25.02,Short,,0,0,0,,over their gills
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:25.88,Short,,0,0,0,,Another idea is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:26.62,Short,,0,0,0,,that hiccups help
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:27.44,Short,,0,0,0,,babies burp out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:28.22,Short,,0,0,0,,air while nursing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:29.28,Short,,0,0,0,,But one man
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.28,Short,,0,0,0,,hiccupped for 68
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:31.32,Short,,0,0,0,,years straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:32.20,Short,,0,0,0,,about 430
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:33.44,Short,,0,0,0,,million times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:34.02,Short,,0,0,0,,and they finally
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.02,0:00:34.76,Short,,0,0,0,,stopped just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:35.10,Short,,0,0,0,,a year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:36.10,Short,,0,0,0,,before he died
